  "notes": "Needs the global parameter MIDI Rx ShortMessage = On. All knobs are 7 bit. The volcas have no USB MIDI, so connect them through a MIDI interface. The envelope and LFO knobs change the voice's settings relative to the stored values (centre = as stored). Transpose is centred. The KORG chart has no value tables: the named steps are spread evenly over 0–127 (untested). Arp div has no names, its steps are not documented.",
